-- the dark blade goes on: no time on it in Affects; 100 mana every 5 s
@1000 conn#4 sends UseSkill 61 target=None
   -> send conn#4 EntityUpdate vid=4 parts=[0, 0, 0, 0] speed=150/100
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 7=245 18=30
   -> send conn#4 Affects 61:3=10 on, 61:10=50 on
   -> send conn#4 EntitySkills vid=4 skills=[61]
@6000 conn#4 sends Pong
@6000 tick
   -> send conn#4 Ping
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 7=286
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 7=186
-- used again it goes off, at once and for nothing
